{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review gate: CERTIFIED. Resolved the carried-over A1 finding (reuse the repo's `**/`-aware glob helper rather than bare fnmatch) plus findings from later rounds: all-or-nothing SHA validation (T6/T5b); a documented `set-file-impact` remedy when the new gate blocks (T4); the oracle.py provenance correction (it uses PLAIN fnmatch, so code_review/registry.py is the only true mirror of the helper); explicit git-error semantics; and a real design bug the reviewer caught (G6) — source-(ii) commit discovery credits the ticket OR any transitive descendant while file_impact was read for THIS ticket only, which would false-BLOCK a parent on child-owned paths. Fixed by unioning file_impact over the same id set discovery uses.\n\nPlan also corrected against real code: the close gate is src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py (there is no src/rebar/workflow/close_gate.py); MCP write tools live in _mcp_writes.py/_mcp_models.py (mcp_server.py only assembles registrars); and BOTH docs/cli-reference.md and docs/mcp-reference.md are GENERATED with CI drift gates, so they are regenerated, not hand-edited.\n\nImplementation: new shared DET module src/rebar/_engine_support/commit_impact.py (SHA validation + path/glob matchers, no rebar.llm import); seam validation in _lib_writes.py; CLI verb + dispatch + pinned help; MCP attach_commits tool with outputSchema; DET check wired into close_precheck with merge-commit skip. Both former _glob_match copies delegate to the shared helper. 21 new tests pass; lint + typecheck green. Two extractions were needed to respect the shrink-only complexity baseline (_completion_precheck back to 16, register_write_tools back to 29)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786518561887030001,"uuid":"28b672a1-76b3-480b-88f8-3cbb010bc3d7"}